<title>JAPAN: LTCB, SBC sign pact on global strategic alliance.</title>
<headline>LTCB, SBC sign pact on global strategic alliance.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Long-Term Credit Bank of Japan said on Tuesday that it and Swiss Bank Corp had signed a letter of intent to form a global strategic alliance. </p>
<p>LTCB said the core of the alliance will be the joint promotion of the investment banking business, including such areas as securities, asset management and private banking.</p>
<p>The bank also said that further details will be announced at a news conference to be held at 5 p.m. (0800 GMT).</p>
</text>
